{
 "id": "shz01-vo-01",
 "model_prefs": [
  "eleven_v4"
 ],
 "items": [
  {
   "name": "V01",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "如果有一天，你要亲手签下一封休书，给你最爱的人。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V02",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "她哭着问你：我清清白白，你为什么不要我？"
  },
  {
   "name": "V03",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "你说不出口——你是怕自己回不来，误了她一辈子。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V04",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "可这一别，就是一辈子。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V05",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "这个人，叫林冲。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V06",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "你本来什么都有：八十万禁军教头，一身本事。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V07",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "家里的娘子，成亲三年，没跟你红过一次脸。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V08",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "你只想，日子就这样过下去。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V09",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "直到那天在岳庙，有人当众调戏她。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V10",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "你一把扳过那人，拳头举了起来——"
  },
  {
   "name": "V11",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "却认出，那是你上司的干儿子。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V12",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "拳头，软了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V13",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "你忍了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V14",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "最好的朋友陆谦，帮着他们害你，"
  },
  {
   "name": "V15",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "你忍了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V16",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "被诬陷，脸上刺字，发配沧州，"
  },
  {
   "name": "V17",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "你还是忍了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V18",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "你总觉得，忍一忍，就能回去。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V19",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "岳父也说：放你回来时，依旧夫妻完聚。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V20",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "到了沧州，你守着一座草料场。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V21",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "那年冬天，雪下得特别大。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V22",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "雪压塌了草屋，你躲进山神庙，搬石头抵住了门。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V23",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "半夜，草料场烧起来了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V24",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "门外有人说：烧死了，拾他一两块骨头回去交差。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V25",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "那个声音，你认得。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V26",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "你终于明白，"
  },
  {
   "name": "V27",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "忍，是回不去的。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V28",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "你推开了门。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V29",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "那一夜雪越下越大，你一个人，上了梁山。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V30",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "你想把娘子接上山，可这件事，一拖再拖。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V31",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "等派去的人回来，只带回一句话："
  },
  {
   "name": "V32",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "娘子被逼，自缢身死，已故半载。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V33",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "你哭了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V34",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "从此，心里再没有可挂念的人。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V35",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "后来，仇人高俅被捉上山，又被好酒好肉送了回去。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V36",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "再后来，你病倒在杭州六和寺，再没起来。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V37",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "你这一辈子，都在等那句：依旧夫妻完聚。"
  },
  {
   "name": "V38",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "如果重来一次，岳庙那一拳，你打不打？"
  },
  {
   "name": "V32b",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "娘子被逼，自缢身死，已故半宰。"
  }
 ]
}